It is the evening tea time.
I am working on the computer.
Then Prakash comes near me.
"Maya, come quickly to the meeting room," Prakash says.
I go quickly to the meeting room.
Deepa and the other team members are standing there.
A beautiful small cake has been placed on the table.
"Happy Birthday, Maya!" they all say together.
I feel a big surprise.
I did not expect this surprise at all.
They have bought this beautiful cake for me.
Deepa lights the candle on the cake.
Everyone sings the birthday song cheerfully.
I say thanks to everyone.
After that, I cut the cake.
We all talk, and have cake and tea together.
After a little while, everyone returns to work again.
